26,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Glossary — every term used above, in plain language","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0R","containerId":null,"originalText":"Glossary — every term used above, in plain language","height":32,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":778920053,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":10,"width":752},{"seed":1527703408,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_68256776_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Control plane \/ execution plane","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0S","containerId":null,"originalText":"Control plane \/ execution plane","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1106169179,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":60,"width":322},{"seed":1415900355,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_68256776_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Just names for two groups of components. Control plane = the API and the database (what users talk to).\nExecution plane = the workers and the processes they spawn (what does the heavy lifting). Separating them lets\neach scale and fail independently.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0T","containerId":null,"originalText":"Just names for two groups of components. Control plane = the API and the database (what users talk to).\nExecution plane = the workers and the processes they spawn (what does the heavy lifting). Separating them lets\neach scale and fail independently.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":859015637,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":88,"width":872},{"seed":838145800,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_28532811_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Stateless API","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0U","containerId":null,"originalText":"Stateless API","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1929538043,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":166,"width":141},{"seed":1720926263,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_28532811_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The API keeps nothing in memory between requests; everything lives in Postgres. So you can run 1 or 10 copies\nbehind a load balancer and kill any of them without losing anything.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0V","containerId":null,"originalText":"The API keeps nothing in memory between requests; everything lives in Postgres. So you can run 1 or 10 copies\nbehind a load balancer and kill any of them without losing anything.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":70092597,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":194,"width":864},{"seed":858641202,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_91066565_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"202 Accepted + polling","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0W","containerId":null,"originalText":"202 Accepted + polling","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1153004187,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":252,"width":231},{"seed":1527129487,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_91066565_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"POST \/v1\/jobs does not wait for the job to finish (that takes an hour). It stores the request and immediately\nanswers '202, here is your job id'. The client then asks GET \/v1\/jobs\/{id} every few seconds until the status\nis terminal. Alternative would be webhooks, which need the client to expose a URL.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0X","containerId":null,"originalText":"POST \/v1\/jobs does not wait for the job to finish (that takes an hour). It stores the request and immediately\nanswers '202, here is your job id'. The client then asks GET \/v1\/jobs\/{id} every few seconds until the status\nis terminal. Alternative would be webhooks, which need the client to expose a URL.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":331405461,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":280,"width":864},{"seed":119988829,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_13376997_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Queue (Postgres as queue)","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0Y","containerId":null,"originalText":"Queue (Postgres as queue)","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":667313979,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":358,"width":262},{"seed":2028255630,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_13376997_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A list of jobs waiting for a worker. Instead of a separate system (Redis, RabbitMQ) we use the jobs table\nitself: rows with status QUEUED are the queue. Benefit: creating the job and enqueuing it is one transaction,\nso they can never disagree.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0Z","containerId":null,"originalText":"A list of jobs waiting for a worker. Instead of a separate system (Redis, RabbitMQ) we use the jobs table\nitself: rows with status QUEUED are the queue. Benefit: creating the job and enqueuing it is one transaction,\nso they can never disagree.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1805843957,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":386,"width":864},{"seed":831698693,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_58505916_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0a","containerId":null,"originalText":"SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1384892379,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":464,"width":322},{"seed":1920828234,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_58505916_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The Postgres trick that makes the table a safe queue. A worker locks the oldest QUEUED row while it claims it;\nany other worker running the same query at the same time skips locked rows and takes the next one. Two workers\ncan never claim the same job.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0b","containerId":null,"originalText":"The Postgres trick that makes the table a safe queue. A worker locks the oldest QUEUED row while it claims it;\nany other worker running the same query at the same time skips locked rows and takes the next one. Two workers\ncan never claim the same job.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1121548117,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":492,"width":872},{"seed":1566099206,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_42667829_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Lease","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0c","containerId":null,"originalText":"Lease","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":186389627,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":570,"width":60},{"seed":946878465,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_42667829_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A time-limited ownership of a job. When a worker claims a job it writes 'owner = W1, expires at now + 60 s'.\nIf the owner stops renewing it (because it crashed), the lease expires and another worker is allowed to take\nthe job over. Think of a library book loan.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0d","containerId":null,"originalText":"A time-limited ownership of a job. When a worker claims a job it writes 'owner = W1, expires at now + 60 s'.\nIf the owner stops renewing it (because it crashed), the lease expires and another worker is allowed to take\nthe job over. Think of a library book loan.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1404683445,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":598,"width":856},{"seed":974295421,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_49712626_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Heartbeat","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0e","containerId":null,"originalText":"Heartbeat","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":825871643,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":676,"width":100},{"seed":844846558,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_49712626_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The periodic renewal of the lease (every 15 s): 'I am still alive, extend my expiry'. A missing heartbeat is\nhow the system detects a dead worker without anyone telling it.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0f","containerId":null,"originalText":"The periodic renewal of the lease (every 15 s): 'I am still alive, extend my expiry'. A missing heartbeat is\nhow the system detects a dead worker without anyone telling it.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1911121429,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":704,"width":856},{"seed":877776916,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_4771269_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Epoch \/ fencing token","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0g","containerId":null,"originalText":"Epoch \/ fencing token","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":139948475,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":762,"width":221},{"seed":8196149,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_4771269_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A counter incremented every time the job changes owner (W1 had epoch 1, W2 takes over with epoch 2). Every\nwrite includes 'WHERE lease_epoch = my epoch'. If the old worker wakes up late and tries to write with epoch\n1, the write matches nothing and is harmlessly ignored. Prevents 'zombie' writers.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0h","containerId":null,"originalText":"A counter incremented every time the job changes owner (W1 had epoch 1, W2 takes over with epoch 2). Every\nwrite includes 'WHERE lease_epoch = my epoch'. If the old worker wakes up late and tries to write with epoch\n1, the write matches nothing and is harmlessly ignored. Prevents 'zombie' writers.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1616763765,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":790,"width":856},{"seed":1477498383,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_71695966_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Compare-and-set (CAS)","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0i","containerId":null,"originalText":"Compare-and-set (CAS)","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1100448347,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":868,"width":221},{"seed":514982154,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_71695966_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Updating a row only if it is still in the state you expect: UPDATE jobs SET status='RUNNING' WHERE id=J1 AND\nstatus='QUEUED'. If someone else changed it first, zero rows update and you know to back off. Cheap optimistic\nconcurrency control.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0j","containerId":null,"originalText":"Updating a row only if it is still in the state you expect: UPDATE jobs SET status='RUNNING' WHERE id=J1 AND\nstatus='QUEUED'. If someone else changed it first, zero rows update and you know to back off. Cheap optimistic\nconcurrency control.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1734124757,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":896,"width":872},{"seed":856070306,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_26683297_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Checkpoint \/ phase","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0k","containerId":null,"originalText":"Checkpoint \/ phase","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1171029755,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":974,"width":191},{"seed":766744960,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_26683297_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"After each step of an iteration (PROVISION, BENCHMARK, COLLECT, …) the worker writes the step name to the\niteration row. On crash-recovery the new worker reads it and resumes from there instead of restarting the\nwhole job.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0l","containerId":null,"originalText":"After each step of an iteration (PROVISION, BENCHMARK, COLLECT, …) the worker writes the step name to the\niteration row. On crash-recovery the new worker reads it and resumes from there instead of restarting the\nwhole job.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":712720949,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1002,"width":833},{"seed":1428150522,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_72715133_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Idempotency key","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0m","containerId":null,"originalText":"Idempotency key","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1064888219,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1080,"width":161},{"seed":1700113407,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_72715133_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A client-chosen header on POST \/v1\/jobs. If the client retries the same request (network blip), the server\nsees the same key for the same org and returns the existing job instead of creating a duplicate.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0n","containerId":null,"originalText":"A client-chosen header on POST \/v1\/jobs. If the client retries the same request (network blip), the server\nsees the same key for the same org and returns the existing job instead of creating a duplicate.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1050620821,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1108,"width":841},{"seed":1723943247,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_42227234_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"At-least-once vs exactly-once","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0o","containerId":null,"originalText":"At-least-once vs exactly-once","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1691302971,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1166,"width":302},{"seed":682281554,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_42227234_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"After a crash we may re-run part of a benchmark that had actually completed (at-least-once). We accept that\nbecause the alternative, guaranteeing exactly-once across a crash, is far more complex, and a duplicated\nsandbox run is cheap and never double-counted (results are keyed by task).","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0p","containerId":null,"originalText":"After a crash we may re-run part of a benchmark that had actually completed (at-least-once). We accept that\nbecause the alternative, guaranteeing exactly-once across a crash, is far more complex, and a duplicated\nsandbox run is cheap and never double-counted (results are keyed by task).","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":2147350773,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1194,"width":848},{"seed":545625653,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_53065729_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Reaper","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0q","containerId":null,"originalText":"Reaper","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":28441819,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1272,"width":70},{"seed":649187325,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_53065729_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A background loop in the worker that lists all live sandboxes at the provider every minute and destroys any\nwhose job is no longer RUNNING or whose epoch is stale. It cleans up after crashes so orphaned microVMs do not\nkeep billing.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0r","containerId":null,"originalText":"A background loop in the worker that lists all live sandboxes at the provider every minute and destroys any\nwhose job is no longer RUNNING or whose epoch is stale. It cleans up after crashes so orphaned microVMs do not\nkeep billing.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":672993877,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1300,"width":872},{"seed":627813882,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_95548213_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Runner subprocess","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0s","containerId":null,"originalText":"Runner subprocess","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1102293371,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1378,"width":181},{"seed":1504988819,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_95548213_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A separate OS process the worker starts for each iteration to run Harbor and the agent code. It is the\nboundary between our worker and the LLM-rewritten agent.py: it gets only three environment variables, its own\nfolder, and is killed as a group on cancel\/timeout.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0t","containerId":null,"originalText":"A separate OS process the worker starts for each iteration to run Harbor and the agent code. It is the\nboundary between our worker and the LLM-rewritten agent.py: it gets only three environment variables, its own\nfolder, and is killed as a group on cancel\/timeout.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":600965045,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1406,"width":864},{"seed":562571391,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_15507963_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Scrubbed environment","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0u","containerId":null,"originalText":"Scrubbed environment","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":974570011,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1484,"width":211},{"seed":61172930,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_15507963_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The runner is started with a hand-built set of env vars (OPENAI_API_KEY, E2B_API_KEY, AGENT_MODEL) rather than\ninheriting the worker's. So even malicious generated code cannot read the DB password or another tenant's\ndata.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0v","containerId":null,"originalText":"The runner is started with a hand-built set of env vars (OPENAI_API_KEY, E2B_API_KEY, AGENT_MODEL) rather than\ninheriting the worker's. So even malicious generated code cannot read the DB password or another tenant's\ndata.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":692207893,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1512,"width":872},{"seed":598077321,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_37431149_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Sandbox \/ microVM","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0w","containerId":null,"originalText":"Sandbox \/ microVM","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":869123771,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1590,"width":181},{"seed":836682997,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_37431149_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"An isolated machine the task runs in. E2B uses Firecracker microVMs: a tiny virtual machine with its own\nkernel, so code inside cannot touch our host. One per task per iteration, destroyed afterwards.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0x","containerId":null,"originalText":"An isolated machine the task runs in. E2B uses Firecracker microVMs: a tiny virtual machine with its own\nkernel, so code inside cannot touch our host. One per task per iteration, destroyed afterwards.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":233002613,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1618,"width":825},{"seed":120232147,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_29863016_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Template (pre-warm)","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0y","containerId":null,"originalText":"Template (pre-warm)","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":897267547,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1676,"width":201},{"seed":913882254,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_29863016_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"E2B's name for a ready-to-boot VM image. Harbor builds one per task from the task's Docker image (slow,\nminutes, once) and then creates sandboxes from it in under a second. 'Pre-warming' = building all 16 before\nthe first job arrives.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b0z","containerId":null,"originalText":"E2B's name for a ready-to-boot VM image. Harbor builds one per task from the task's Docker image (slow,\nminutes, once) and then creates sandboxes from it in under a second. 'Pre-warming' = building all 16 before\nthe first job arrives.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1551548373,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1704,"width":848},{"seed":1033108813,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_73322081_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Harbor","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b10","containerId":null,"originalText":"Harbor","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1299289083,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1782,"width":70},{"seed":1113963314,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_73322081_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The open-source framework Terminal-Bench 2.0 is distributed on. `harbor run` downloads the task, boots the\nsandbox, runs our agent, runs the task's hidden tests, and writes result.json + logs. The repo already uses\nit; we call it per iteration.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b11","containerId":null,"originalText":"The open-source framework Terminal-Bench 2.0 is distributed on. `harbor run` downloads the task, boots the\nsandbox, runs our agent, runs the task's hidden tests, and writes result.json + logs. The repo already uses\nit; we call it per iteration.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":723385653,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1810,"width":848},{"seed":562957180,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_25837246_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Trial \/ task_run","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b12","containerId":null,"originalText":"Trial \/ task_run","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":464739483,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1888,"width":171},{"seed":1519490801,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_25837246_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"One execution of one task with one agent version. Harbor calls it a trial; our table is task_runs. Holds\nreward (0\/1), duration, failure class, test output and the trace.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b13","containerId":null,"originalText":"One execution of one task with one agent version. Harbor calls it a trial; our table is task_runs. Holds\nreward (0\/1), duration, failure class, test output and the trace.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":825396885,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1916,"width":825},{"seed":1806584668,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_47574175_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Verifier","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b14","containerId":null,"originalText":"Verifier","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":468914491,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":1974,"width":90},{"seed":652132316,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_47574175_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The task's hidden test script that decides pass\/fail after the agent finishes. Its stdout is the most valuable\nsignal for the optimizer because it says WHY the task failed, not what the agent believed.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b15","containerId":null,"originalText":"The task's hidden test script that decides pass\/fail after the agent finishes. Its stdout is the most valuable\nsignal for the optimizer because it says WHY the task failed, not what the agent believed.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":493745141,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2002,"width":872},{"seed":1890322093,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_38290930_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Trace \/ dossier","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b16","containerId":null,"originalText":"Trace \/ dossier","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":798175707,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2060,"width":161},{"seed":16889874,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_38290930_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Trace = the full conversation of the agent for a task (every command and its output). Dossier = our compact\nsummary of a failed trace (instruction, last 8 steps, final message, test output, failure class) that we send\nto the LLM instead of the raw trace.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b17","containerId":null,"originalText":"Trace = the full conversation of the agent for a task (every command and its output). Dossier = our compact\nsummary of a failed trace (instruction, last 8 steps, final message, test output, failure class) that we send\nto the LLM instead of the raw trace.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":735423829,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2088,"width":864},{"seed":740223520,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_48683315_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Failure class","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b18","containerId":null,"originalText":"Failure class","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1738948219,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2166,"width":141},{"seed":2033636663,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_48683315_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A label we assign to each failed task_run: timeout, gave_up_early, wrong_output, loop_detected, tool_misuse,\nenv_setup_failure, agent_exception, infra_error. Lets the LLM see patterns ('5 of 7 failures are timeouts').","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b19","containerId":null,"originalText":"A label we assign to each failed task_run: timeout, gave_up_early, wrong_output, loop_detected, tool_misuse,\nenv_setup_failure, agent_exception, infra_error. Lets the LLM see patterns ('5 of 7 failures are timeouts').","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":2076129973,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2194,"width":856},{"seed":265236939,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_35999534_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Agent version (content-addressed)","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1A","containerId":null,"originalText":"Agent version (content-addressed)","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":250525467,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2252,"width":342},{"seed":2072265938,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_35999534_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Each agent.py the loop produces is stored once, keyed by the SHA-256 of its text. Identical code = same id, so\na 'revert' or a duplicate proposal costs nothing and the history is an exact tree of parents.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1B","containerId":null,"originalText":"Each agent.py the loop produces is stored once, keyed by the SHA-256 of its text. Identical code = same id, so\na 'revert' or a duplicate proposal costs nothing and the history is an exact tree of parents.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":634395669,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2280,"width":872},{"seed":244051093,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_62477291_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Hypothesis \/ proposal","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1C","containerId":null,"originalText":"Hypothesis \/ proposal","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1944001467,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2338,"width":221},{"seed":821653593,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_62477291_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"What we ask the LLM for each iteration: ONE idea ('the agent never verifies before finishing'), the tasks it\ntargets, and the full rewritten agent.py. One idea per iteration keeps the effect measurable and revertible.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1D","containerId":null,"originalText":"What we ask the LLM for each iteration: ONE idea ('the agent never verifies before finishing'), the tasks it\ntargets, and the full rewritten agent.py. One idea per iteration keeps the effect measurable and revertible.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":301846901,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2366,"width":856},{"seed":181242850,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_82768601_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Hill climbing","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1E","containerId":null,"originalText":"Hill climbing","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1922690139,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2424,"width":141},{"seed":1942080813,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_82768601_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"The search strategy: always propose from the best version so far; accept the candidate only if it scores\nhigher; otherwise discard it. Simple, explainable, and the right default when each evaluation costs minutes.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1F","containerId":null,"originalText":"The search strategy: always propose from the best version so far; accept the candidate only if it scores\nhigher; otherwise discard it. Simple, explainable, and the right default when each evaluation costs minutes.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":227400405,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2452,"width":856},{"seed":272167094,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_14480014_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Flip confirmation","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1G","containerId":null,"originalText":"Flip confirmation","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1056024827,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2510,"width":181},{"seed":1398499908,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_14480014_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Noise control. If a candidate changed the outcome of only a few tasks, re-run just those tasks once more and\ntake the majority before accepting. Costs 2–4 task-runs instead of a full 16-task repeat.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1H","containerId":null,"originalText":"Noise control. If a candidate changed the outcome of only a few tasks, re-run just those tasks once more and\ntake the majority before accepting. Costs 2–4 task-runs instead of a full 16-task repeat.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":555071541,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2538,"width":856},{"seed":1190502837,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_77158702_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Two-phase evaluation","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1I","containerId":null,"originalText":"Two-phase evaluation","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1852363163,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2596,"width":211},{"seed":2053150340,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_77158702_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Cost control. Run the candidate on the currently failing tasks first; if none of them now pass there is no\nupside, so reject without running the passing tasks. Only if something improved do we run the full set to\ncheck for regressions.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1J","containerId":null,"originalText":"Cost control. Run the candidate on the currently failing tasks first; if none of them now pass there is no\nupside, so reject without running the passing tasks. Only if something improved do we run the full set to\ncheck for regressions.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":645589397,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2624,"width":841},{"seed":1114940396,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_35952966_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Canary task","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1K","containerId":null,"originalText":"Canary task","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1110566459,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2702,"width":120},{"seed":1922119102,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_35952966_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"A task the baseline agent almost always passes. It carries no learning signal but detects regressions: if a\ncanary starts failing, the change broke something general.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1L","containerId":null,"originalText":"A task the baseline agent almost always passes. It carries no learning signal but detects regressions: if a\ncanary starts failing, the change broke something general.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":519237365,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2730,"width":848},{"seed":1789442529,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_10385420_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Patience","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1M","containerId":null,"originalText":"Patience","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":825190107,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2788,"width":90},{"seed":1685192165,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_10385420_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Stop rule: give up after N consecutive iterations with no accepted improvement (default 3).","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1N","containerId":null,"originalText":"Stop rule: give up after N consecutive iterations with no accepted improvement (default 3).","height":17,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1224951893,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2816,"width":723},{"seed":1357122901,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_90340495_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Budget","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1O","containerId":null,"originalText":"Budget","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":838062971,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2854,"width":70},{"seed":1033535610,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_90340495_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Hard caps per job: max iterations, max wall-clock minutes, max LLM dollars, max sandbox minutes. Any of them\nexhausted → stop and finalize with the best so far.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1P","containerId":null,"originalText":"Hard caps per job: max iterations, max wall-clock minutes, max LLM dollars, max sandbox minutes. Any of them\nexhausted → stop and finalize with the best so far.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1988195765,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2882,"width":856},{"seed":314051310,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_60229939_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Tenancy \/ principal \/ role","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1Q","containerId":null,"originalText":"Tenancy \/ principal \/ role","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1153543195,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2940,"width":272},{"seed":1300430509,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_60229939_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Multi-tenancy = several organisations on one deployment. Principal = who is calling (org, user, role) resolved\nfrom the API key. Role admin can see and cancel all jobs in the org; member only their own. Enforced by adding\nWHERE org_id = … to every query; cross-org ids return 404, not 403, so tenants cannot probe each other.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1R","containerId":null,"originalText":"Multi-tenancy = several organisations on one deployment. Principal = who is calling (org, user, role) resolved\nfrom the API key. Role admin can see and cancel all jobs in the org; member only their own. Enforced by adding\nWHERE org_id = … to every query; cross-org ids return 404, not 403, so tenants cannot probe each other.","height":52,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":580056853,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":2968,"width":872},{"seed":663343194,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_77281549_term","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":18,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Quota","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1S","containerId":null,"originalText":"Quota","height":22,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1032548539,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":3046,"width":60},{"seed":614090117,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"g_77281549_def","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Per-org limits (e.g. 2 concurrent jobs) enforced inside the claim query, so one busy organisation cannot\nstarve another of workers.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1T","containerId":null,"originalText":"Per-org limits (e.g. 2 concurrent jobs) enforced inside the claim query, so one busy organisation cannot\nstarve another of workers.","height":35,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#343a40","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1202539637,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":1500,"angle":0,"y":3074,"width":825},{"seed":589504031,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_title","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":26,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"Worked example — two organisations, step by step","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1U","containerId":null,"originalText":"Worked example — two organisations, step by step","height":32,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1307812187,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":1,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1600,"width":708},{"seed":943122534,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1650","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"1. Sam (Acme) runs test_client.py → POST \/v1\/jobs. API resolves key → Acme\/Sam\/member, checks quota, inserts job J1 (QUEUED) + event in one\ntransaction, returns 202.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1V","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. Sam (Acme) runs test_client.py → POST \/v1\/jobs. API resolves key → Acme\/Sam\/member, checks quota, inserts job J1 (QUEUED) + event in one\ntransaction, returns 202.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1972762069,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1650,"width":1177},{"seed":1710500231,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1704","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"2. Lee (Beta) does the same a second later → J2. Postgres holds two QUEUED rows with different org_id. That table IS the queue.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1W","containerId":null,"originalText":"2. Lee (Beta) does the same a second later → J2. Postgres holds two QUEUED rows with different org_id. That table IS the queue.","height":18,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1330429435,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1704,"width":1076},{"seed":699199910,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1738","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"3. Worker W1 claims J1 (lease 60 s, epoch 1) via SKIP LOCKED; W2 claims J2. Neither can take the other's job. Per-org quota is checked in the same\nquery.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1X","containerId":null,"originalText":"3. Worker W1 claims J1 (lease 60 s, epoch 1) via SKIP LOCKED; W2 claims J2. Neither can take the other's job. Per-org quota is checked in the same\nquery.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":660763445,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1738,"width":1236},{"seed":693491441,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1792","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"4. Iteration 0 for J1: W1 writes agent v0, spawns the runner with 3 env vars. Harbor boots 16 E2B microVMs from templates; agent loop in the runner,\nbash + tests in the VMs. W1 heartbeats and records task_runs as results land.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1Y","containerId":null,"originalText":"4. Iteration 0 for J1: W1 writes agent v0, spawns the runner with 3 env vars. Harbor boots 16 E2B microVMs from templates; agent loop in the runner,\nbash + tests in the VMs. W1 heartbeats and records task_runs as results land.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1285113499,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1792,"width":1253},{"seed":1734349672,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1846","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"5. Runner exits: 9\/16 pass. W1 stores rewards\/traces\/test output, classifies the 7 failures, asks the LLM for ONE hypothesis + new agent.py, validates\nit → v1. Each phase name is checkpointed.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1Z","containerId":null,"originalText":"5. Runner exits: 9\/16 pass. W1 stores rewards\/traces\/test output, classifies the 7 failures, asks the LLM for ONE hypothesis + new agent.py, validates\nit → v1. Each phase name is checkpointed.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1501054101,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1846,"width":1270},{"seed":1809368695,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1900","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"6. Iteration 1: run v1 on the 7 failing tasks first → 3 flip to pass → now run the other 9 → 1 regresses → 11\/16. Re-run the 4 flipped tasks to\nconfirm. Accept: v1 is the new parent.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1a","containerId":null,"originalText":"6. Iteration 1: run v1 on the 7 failing tasks first → 3 flip to pass → now run the other 9 → 1 regresses → 11\/16. Re-run the 4 flipped tasks to\nconfirm. Accept: v1 is the new parent.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1284225851,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1900,"width":1211},{"seed":1531648886,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1954","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"7. Meanwhile Sam polls GET \/v1\/jobs\/J1 → 200. Lee asks for J1 → 404 (query scoped to Beta). Priya (admin) lists all Acme jobs and may cancel J1.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1b","containerId":null,"originalText":"7. Meanwhile Sam polls GET \/v1\/jobs\/J1 → 200. Lee asks for J1 → 404 (query scoped to Beta). Priya (admin) lists all Acme jobs and may cancel J1.","height":18,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1603070453,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1954,"width":1219},{"seed":395970335,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_1988","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"8. W1 dies during iteration 2. Lease expires → W2 claims J1 with epoch 2, resumes BENCHMARK for the tasks without results; reaper kills J1 sandboxes\ntagged epoch 1; zombie writes from W1 (epoch 1) match nothing.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1c","containerId":null,"originalText":"8. W1 dies during iteration 2. Lease expires → W2 claims J1 with epoch 2, resumes BENCHMARK for the tasks without results; reaper kills J1 sandboxes\ntagged epoch 1; zombie writes from W1 (epoch 1) match nothing.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1535548379,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":1988,"width":1253},{"seed":83678550,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"d_2042","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1794035002418,"locked":false,"text":"9. After 3 consecutive rejections (or iteration cap \/ budget \/ score 1.0 \/ cancel) → FINALIZE → SUCCEEDED. test_client.py prints baseline 9\/16, best\n12\/16, every hypothesis + decision, and the v0→best diff.","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"b1d","containerId":null,"originalText":"9. After 3 consecutive rejections (or iteration cap \/ budget \/ score 1.0 \/ cancel) → FINALIZE → SUCCEEDED. test_client.py prints baseline 9\/16, best\n12\/16, every hypothesis + decision, and the v0→best diff.","height":37,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#212529","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":2057691989,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":40,"angle":0,"y":2042,"width":1253},{"isDeleted":true,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","link":null,"roughness":1,"groupIds":[],"index":"b1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":49,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1794035018990,"id":"UYb3QsO-3uhPOTQmGUQvm","x":-94.16796875,"seed":2080663643,"boundElements":null,"y":271.27734375,"opacity":100,"height":176.59765625,"width":650.04296875,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":1114746165}],"type":"excalidraw","files":{},"source":"https:\/\/excalidraw.com"}